WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.587
An operations-led discussion may preserve the morning plan Daniel

00:00:04.666 --> 00:00:07.679
could recommend that the appointed operations owner handle the

00:00:07.719 --> 00:00:12.600
supplier discussion This would protect Lindiwe’s preparation and decision

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.771
meeting but only if the discussion falls within that

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:20.521
person’s delegation and the person accepts the assignment Lindiwe’s

00:00:20.561 --> 00:00:25.166
approval must also be obtained where required These conditions

00:00:25.219 --> 00:00:27.455
are not supplied as confirmed facts
